WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:01.088
What's a Flow?

00:02.150 --> 00:05.278
A Flow is a habit or practice with a schedule built in.

00:06.000 --> 00:11.742
A workout routine. A meal plan. A reading plan. Or something entirely your own.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.923
The activities, and when to do them, come together as one Flow.

00:17.450 --> 00:21.110
Create your own. Find one in the feed. Share it with a friend.

00:21.350 --> 00:24.749
Or start with one of the guided Ma'at Flows already in the app.

00:25.000 --> 00:28.643
Carry it into your calendar. Practice on your own, or together.

00:28.900 --> 00:34.415
Instead of saving a post you never come back to, a Flow returns in rhythm to push you forward.

00:34.850 --> 00:37.530
Find your Flow. This is Hꜣw.
